{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"kiln","model_identifier":"kiln","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# kiln\n\nKiln: a domed clay kiln with a glowing firing door and a short flue, stacks of fired bricks, and an earth-covered charcoal mound beside it.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 6 columns (128 x 96 units, 3.60 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -64..76, y 0..62, z -37..40 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 40, construction_0 12, construction_33 16, construction_66 30, ruined 16 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- kiln: 52 x 62 x 52 centred at the origin\n- charcoal mound: 40 x 24 x 40 at x 56, z 20\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `kiln_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `kiln_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_kiln` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 1.6 | loop | `bellows` bellows pump. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_smoke` at (0, 64, 0)\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 12, -28)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (56, 25, 20)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-50, 0, -30)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"base","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-26.0,0.0,-26.0],"to":[26.0,4.0,26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[10.0,164.0,62.0,168.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10.0,164.0,62.0,168.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10.0,164.0,62.0,168.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10.0,164.0,62.0,168.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8.0,0.0,60.0,52.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8.0,0.0,60.0,52.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e7b5e886-a77c-5756-b505-53f686e2262c"},{"name":"kiln_a","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24.0,4.0,-10.08],"to":[24.0,28.0,10.08],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[122.0,72.0,170.0,96.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[208.92,72.0,229.08,96.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[122.0,72.0,170.0,96.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[208.92,72.0,229.08,96.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[60.0,106.92,108.0,127.08],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[60.0,106.92,108.0,127.08],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"82e764dd-b0ec-5e5a-aa39-6f75f1de3d12"},{"name":"kiln_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.08,4.0,-24.0],"to":[10.08,28.0,24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[208.92,72.0,229.08,96.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[122.0,72.0,170.0,96.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[208.92,72.0,229.08,96.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[122.0,72.0,170.0,96.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[82.92,0.0,103.08,48.0],"te