":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"e44b355b-f6ad-5fc3-966f-134b6df4e513","time":0.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":-12.0}],"uuid":"a082f94f-cc4c-54f7-836e-2fb39757c509","time":0.72,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"d0496865-5646-530a-9b9e-13000949d15e","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# kiln\n\nKiln: a domed clay kiln with a glowing firing door and a short flue, stacks of fired bricks, and an earth-covered charcoal mound beside it.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 6 columns (128 x 96 units, 3.60 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -64..76, y 0..62, z -37..40 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 40, construction_0 12, construction_33 16, construction_66 30, ruined 16 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- kiln: 52 x 62 x 52 centred at the origin\n- charcoal mound: 40 x 24 x 40 at x 56, z 20\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `kiln_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `kiln_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_kiln` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 1.6 | loop | `bellows` bellows pump. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_smoke` at (0, 64, 0)\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 12, -28)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (56, 25, 20)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-50, 0, -30)\n"}